lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote class="md-blockquote"&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;註1：&lt;/strong&gt; 稽核可以是內部稽核（第一方）或外部稽核（第二方或第三方），可以是結合稽核（結合兩個或兩個以上學科）。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h3 id="34-稽核範圍audit-scope"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#34-%e7%a8%bd%e6%a0%b8%e7%af%84%e5%9c%8daudit-scope" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.4 稽核範圍（Audit Scope）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="35-鑑別authentication"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#35-%e9%91%91%e5%88%a5authentication" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.5 鑑別（Authentication）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="36-真實性authenticity"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#36-%e7%9c%9f%e5%af%a6%e6%80%a7authenticity" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.6 真實性（Authenticity）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="37-可用性availability"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#37-%e5%8f%af%e7%94%a8%e6%80%a7availability" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.7 可用性（Availability）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="38-基本測度base-measure"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#38-%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e6%b8%ac%e5%ba%a6base-measure" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.8 基本測度（Base Measure）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="39-能力competence"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#39-%e8%83%bd%e5%8a%9bcompetence" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.9 能力（Competence）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="310-保密性confidentiality"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#310-%e4%bf%9d%e5%af%86%e6%80%a7confidentiality" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.10 保密性（Confidentiality）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="311-符合性conformity"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#311-%e7%ac%a6%e5%90%88%e6%80%a7conformity" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.11 符合性（Conformity）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="312-後果consequence"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#312-%e5%be%8c%e6%9e%9cconsequence" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.12 後果（Consequence）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote class="md-blockquote"&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;註1：&lt;/strong&gt; 一個事態可能導致一系列後果。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/blockquote&gt;</description></item><item><title>PowerPoint 背景圖弄不到的話，右鍵調整版面配置</title><link>https://tuobaling.github.io/blog/powerpoint-bakcground/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 22:34:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://tuobaling.github.io/blog/powerpoint-bakcground/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如題&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="md-image"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/1dce5fdc-84b8-4a67-b95a-ebdee75d40c4/08751bb8-363d-47cf-b26b-6f74e0e23551/messageImage_1778769030702.jpg?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB4665HWADW56%2F20261114%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;amp;X-Amz-Date=20261114T034808Z&amp;amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEMr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIQCpBkgFCwMyOZW6kAaT8WGOm8h3za2Yv23y8Qam%2BV5umwIgOOTigoJqJ2f7KibwZujD23YZ6QcHOSQzXbb153U2hoMqiAQIkv%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAAGgw2Mzc0MjMxODM4MDUiDGE6ceVVw83PxN3kGircA7tmXIfH7pZlaaJSXh98RH4kbFfON%2FBSiwUum1BKQtBzk6WwaYDL1uwbNsSuPragkWVY2BryAeT2prA7YJvIEi9s7p%2Bhltj4F8rdbVDbCJJfvJmfsh75foFePrMhW9COlbSHjaC5sHGG2JjYRatn8XZrLaZA9Gya1hGvyBQtcj2wKP6dkUEgJXDDqLg7ws8hM1T%2Bs6oRaCibR6LJkYbI9cIe7yYDxMy93R8wR3gm3RY5aNJUPxdwi6V48Tp7K%2Bd3YIlh3gqdhdhtzXi%2BJu8gKiN%2BWj%2FyZdUuSbJznsfWnSDiTdcFKX54Ajt5RS0XNVI%2Bj4qhj%2B%2F5UjhFLD5I%2FWketuSEEjnFiT%2BJqmLaQwf%2FLRQKWkpTjFLueoX0eglRwOGdmtpW9LI%2Fc6u91KQ6wZ8ThxkhgIocyPogkjQkVxbYNXQzC9oQNLW4u7Zs8noMv6ixQk%2Fwg%2BXGg4MauQf3zIQNxFJo5wFMy8theZQB%2BW%2BG8TDNn08VDkI6mAepe2J%2FiUzYVt0wYZyA%2Fp8exSzW6bAOuB8TRoarz0N56wVzSfnTk13cRuWVg4Dul4SlSy9NQ421F50pU%2BQs2SYIaix6Iv%2FnfOBsz5gtBZWEZpmqOO8KY2tVknaoqHUhFxrUPdpjMMf33tcGOqUBpiOprSa9h1L5V9s5D5%2BFW87eTMCcAgStmvuXMm%2B%2B4bdprkIEPYGAfMHTsKBVBhf7SV49GJeglIjVAUSslqRlCGCu%2BRQqkJtqpLgd6DBfguCKqF2SG9gJEpop%2BdoXdUp8jynTk5PDkUxGcvObCAJKZJhtuuKi6ahsrsW%2FiXsE65cadeP7DBvBjPzV%2FoOIVQFEpHZ4k8k4ZuXvz28cPj0ZeSpnmdjo&a